Original Decipher card face for [[Bossk With Mortar Gun]], as shown in the Enhanced Jabba's Palace card list on Decipher's own website.

Source: [http://decipher.com/starwars/cardlists/enhancedjabbaspalace/dark/images/bosskwithmortargun.gif bosskwithmortargun.gif], Decipher.com card list. Preserved copy: [https://web.archive.org/web/20020403221132/http://decipher.com/starwars/cardlists/enhancedjabbaspalace/dark/images/bosskwithmortargun.gif Internet Archive], 3 April 2002. SHA-256 of the archived file: 80a8b58c37f1463869e7405494c98d7b4b71325cfc4f43eb693ab7ee27f59090.

Edits: none. The archived bytes are uploaded unchanged.

The Holotable face [[:File:EJP-D-bosskwithmortargun.gif]] is a separate file and is not replaced by this file.

